{"t":"AON","made":"2026-11-14 00:19","name":"Aon plc","ko":null,"sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance Brokers","employees":60000,"hq":"Dublin, Ireland","website":"https://www.aon.com","summary_en":"Aon plc operates as a professional services firm in the United States, rest of the Americas, the United Kingdom, Ireland, rest of Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the Asia Pacific. It operates through Risk Capital and Human Capital segments. The company offers commercial risk solutions comprising retail and insurance brokerage, specialty solutions, global risk consulting, captives management, and affinity programs; health solutions, such as consulting and brokerage, consumer benefits, and talent advisory services; and wealth solutions, including retirement consulting and investments. It also provides treaty and facultative reinsurance; strategy and technology group solutions; insurance-linked securities, capital raising, strategic advice, restructuring, and merger and acquisition services; and risk management products and solutions, capital market solutions, and corporate finance advisory services. In addition, the company offers strategic design advice and actuarial services; pension risk transfer and integrated pension administration; and investment advisory services on developing and maintaining investment programs across various plan types, including defined benefit plans, defined contribution plans, master trusts, and pooled employer plans for corporations, public pensions, endowments, and foundations. Aon plc was incorporated in 1979 and is headquartered in Dublin, Ireland.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Aon plc는 미국, 미주 지역, 영국, 아일랜드, 유럽 지역, 중동, 아프리카 및 아시아 태평양 지역에서 전문 서비스 회사로 운영되고 있습니다. 이는 Risk Capital 및 Human Capital 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 소매 및 보험 중개, 전문 솔루션, 글로벌 위험 컨설팅, 전속 관리 및 친화 프로그램으로 구성된 상업 위험 솔루션을 제공합니다. 컨설팅 및 중개, 소비자 혜택, 인재 자문 서비스 등의 건강 솔루션; 은퇴 컨설팅, 투자 등 자산 솔루션을 제공합니다. 또한 조약 및 임시 재보험도 제공합니다. 전략 및 기술 그룹 솔루션; 보험 연계 증권, 자본 조달, 전략적 조언, 구조 조정, 인수 합병 서비스; 위험 관리 제품 및 솔루션, 자본 시장 솔루션, 기업 금융 자문 서비스 등이 있습니다. 또한 회사는 전략적 설계 조언과 보험 통계 서비스를 제공합니다. 연금 위험 전가 및 통합 연금 관리; 기업, 공적 연금, 기부금 및 재단을 위한 확정 혜택 계획, 확정 기여 계획, 마스터 트러스트 및 공동 고용주 계획을 포함하여 다양한 계획 유형에 걸친 투자 프로그램 개발 및 유지에 대한 투자 자문 서비스. Aon plc는 1979년에 설립되었으며 아일랜드 더블린에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":338.57,"mcap":71830061056.0,"pe":18.531473,"fpe":16.756304,"peg":2.7614,"ps":4.0625563,"pb":7.1126657,"ev_ebitda":14.177,"div":0.98,"beta":0.613,"hi52":382.34,"lo52":266.33},"fin":{"rev":17681000448.0,"rev_g":0.026,"eps_g":0.057,"gross":0.48402,"op":0.28805,"net":0.22239,"roe":0.43375,"fcf":4397250048.0,"cash":15150999552.0,"debt":28948000768.0,"de":283.332,"eps":18.27,"feps":20.20553},"own":{"short":0.0183,"inst":0.93666,"insider":0.01012},"analyst":{"n":19,"mean":363.21054,"median":363.0,"high":435.0,"low":259.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.04762,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":10,"hold":6,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":9,"hold":6,"sell":1,"strongSell":2},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":4,"buy":9,"hold":5,"sell":1,"strongSell":2},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":9,"hold":7,"sell":0,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"BMO Capital","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Market Perform","Action":"up","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":380.0,"priorPriceTarget":319.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":356.0,"priorPriceTarget":387.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":364.0,"priorPriceTarget":323.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Cantor Fitzgerald","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":410.0,"priorPriceTarget":400.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Raym